  "necessary_findings": [
    {
      "id": "MR04",
      "classification": "necessary",
      "status": "open",
      "title": "Qwen額外speaker檔案未受指定revision固定",
      "locations": [
        "scripts/omni_revision/qwen_research.py:112",
        "transformers4.57.6/modeling_qwen2_5_omni.py:3736"
      ],
      "finding": "目前以remote model ID＋revision載入Qwen。該版本的from_pretrained明示revision/local_files_only/token參數已被函式綁定取出，後續載spk_dict.pt卻從kwargs.pop重新取值，得到revision=None、local_files_only=False、token=None；因此super權重的f75... pin不能保證speaker素材也來自同commit。",
      "independent_counterexample": "未使用作者mock；從本地已安裝4.57.6 source SHA830855...擷取verbatim method AST，獨立假super確收到f75...與local_only=True，speaker cached_file卻收到None/False。再執行真cached_file/cached_files來源的local-directory分支，私有固定spk bytes精確回讀成功，沒有網路或神經模型。",
      "evidence": "current-v2-qwen-upstream-result.json",
      "required_resolution": "把所有必要Qwen素材（包括spk_dict.pt）固定到指定revision的本地snapshot，再讓processor/model從該本地路徑以local_files_only載入；保存實際snapshot/auxiliary素材SHA來源並驗止remote最新版本回退。可對ASR採一致模式，維持原GPU/生成次數/caps。"
    },
    {
      "id": "MR05",
      "classification": "necessary",
      "status": "open",
      "title": "Qwen的BF16敘述未區分官方Token2Wav FP32路徑",
      "locations": [
        "scripts/omni_revision/qwen_research.py:222",
        "docs/omni-products/v1/mature-research-protocol.md:9",
        "transformers4.57.6/modeling_qwen2_5_omni.py:4000"
      ],
      "finding": "目前result dtype與protocol概括為完整BF16；上游enable_talker及generate會對token2wav.float()，generate也將conditioning/reference_mel與最終wave轉FP32。requested BF16 load不代表整條語音計算為BF16。",
      "independent_counterexample": "逐字source的if self.token2wav.dtype != torch.float: self.token2wav.float()被獨立AST replay在非神經假component上重現BF16→FP32；未把它當成真模型component量測。",
      "evidence": "current-v2-qwen-upstream-result.json",
      "required_resolution": "文案／結果區分requested load、Thinker/Talker與官方Token2Wav FP32行為，並記錄實際component dtype；沒有真執行到的階段不得捏造觀察。此為精度來源修正，不新增量化、GPU升級或預算。"
    }
  ],
